<title>ITALY: Italy Treasury plans Autostrade sale by end summer.</title>
<headline>Italy Treasury plans Autostrade sale by end summer.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian Treasury plans to sell motorway operating company Autostrade by the end of the summer, director-general Mario Draghi said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;It is the Treasury's intention to carry out the privatisation before or during the summer,&quot; Draghi told a news conference.</p>
<p>State industrial holding IRI owns 87 percent of Autostrade.</p>
<p>-- Rome newsroom +396 678 2501</p>
